=   entry .Error   raised when a DNS name or message is not valid, or a name does not resolve
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.100.1`: _the DNS message is not valid because `reason`_. Raised by name construction
-         and parsing, by `Rdata.Txt`, by decoding a message from `Data`, by `Dns.resolve`, and
-         as a compile error by `dns"…"`.
-     entry .Reason   why a name, message or lookup failed
+         Ошибка `↯/s.100.1`: _the DNS message is not valid because `reason`_. Порождается
+         построением и разбором имён, `Rdata.Txt`, декодированием сообщения из `Data`,
+         `Dns.resolve` и, как ошибка компиляции, `dns"…"`.
+     entry .Reason   почему не удалось имя, сообщение или поиск

=     entry .Reason   why a name, message or lookup failed
-       detail
+       detail

-           Each has a message through `Reason.communicable`:
+           У каждой причины есть сообщение через `Reason.communicable`:

=           Each has a message through `Reason.communicable`:
=
-           ```tabular
+           ```tabular

-           column  Case
-           column  Code
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
-           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  a bad name
-           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  a bad name
-           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  a TXT string
-           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  a malformed message
-           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  from `Dns.resolve`
-           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  raised by a transport such as `coaxial.dns`
-           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  raised by a transport, for a response with the wrong ID
+           column  Кейс
+           column  Код
+           column  Сообщение
+           column  Примечание
+           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  некорректное сообщение
+           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  некорректное сообщение
+           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  некорректное сообщение
+           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  неверное имя
+           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  неверное имя
+           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  неверное имя
+           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  неверное имя
+           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  некорректное сообщение
+           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  строка TXT
+           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  некорректное сообщение
